@niagaranutritionpartners serves more than 24,000 students at over 200 schools across every single day. They do all this with federal and provincial funding that amounts to approximately 39 cents per student per day.

This morning, I was delighted to attend Niagara Nutrition Partners' 10th Annual Breakfast Gala. This gala features breakfast items prepared by our high school culinary programs.

Together, we raised over $42,000 to support student nutrition. 🍎 🍏
